        "*": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"infobox darktable\" cellspacing=\"3\" style=\"border-spacing:3px;width:22em;width:21.5em;\"><tbody><tr class=\"above-header\"><th colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;font-size:125%;font-weight:bold;padding:5px;\"><span style=\"display:table;width:100%;border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0;\"><span style=\"display:table-row;\"><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:5px;width:1px;\"><span class=\"\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><img alt=\"Alliance\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Alliance 32.png\" data-image-key=\"Alliance_32.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/25/Alliance_32.png/revision/latest?cb=20110620204931\" /></a></span></span></span><span style=\"display:table-cell;vertical-align:middle;padding-right:2px;\">Lord Hewell</span></span></span></th></tr><tr><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<span typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/7/7c/Lord_Hewell.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20151105191116\" class=\"mw-file-description image\" title=\"Image of Lord Hewell\"><img alt=\"Image of Lord Hewell\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"141\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Lord Hewell.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Lord_Hewell.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/7/7c/Lord_Hewell.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/141?cb=20151105191116\" /></a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Gender</th><td>\nMale</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Race</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">Human</a>&#160;(Humanoid)</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Level</th><td>\n1-30</td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Resource</th><td>\n<span class=\"cc-shaman\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mana_(game_resource)\" title=\"Mana (game resource)\">Mana</a></span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Reaction</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Alliance\" title=\"Alliance\"><span class=\"rep-friendly\" title=\"Friendly\">Alliance</span></a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Affiliation(s)</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(faction)\" title=\"Gilneas (faction)\">Gilneas</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Occupation</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Nobles_of_Gilneas\" title=\"Nobles of Gilneas\">Noble</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\" style=\"text-align:left;background-color:transparent;\">Location</th><td>\n<a href=\"/wiki/Tempest%27s_Reach\" title=\"Tempest&#39;s Reach\">Tempest's Reach</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(starting_zone)\" title=\"Gilneas (starting zone)\">Gilneas</a><span><span class=\"tttemplatelink coords-link noexcerpt\" data-coords=\"/way 78.2 72.0\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_(starting_zone)\" title=\"Gilneas (starting zone)\"><sup>[78.2,&#160;72.0]</sup></a></span><span style=\"display:none;\"><span class=\"ZoneMap\" style=\"position:relative;width:300px;height:200px;display:block\"><span class=\"notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"300\" height=\"200\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"WorldMap-Gilneas.jpg\" data-image-key=\"WorldMap-Gilneas.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/e4/WorldMap-Gilneas.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/300?cb=20190626134742\" /></span></span><span style=\"position:absolute;left:78.2%;top:72.0%;line-height:0;margin:-5.5px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size notpageimage\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Blip.png\" data-image-key=\"Blip.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/f4/Blip.png/revision/latest?cb=20101220042049\" /></span></span></span></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Lord Hewell</b> is a nobleman of <a href=\"/wiki/Gilneas_peninsula\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Gilneas peninsula\">Gilneas</a> who can be found at <a href=\"/wiki/Tempest%27s_Reach\" title=\"Tempest&#39;s Reach\">Tempest's Reach</a> during the <a href=\"/wiki/Worgen_starting_experience\" title=\"Worgen starting experience\">worgen starting experience</a>. Though the eastern lords (<a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Walden\" title=\"Lord Walden\">Lord Walden</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Baron_Ashbury\" title=\"Baron Ashbury\">Baron Ashbury</a>) took part in <a href=\"/wiki/Lord_Godfrey\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Lord Godfrey\">Lord Godfrey</a>'s plan to take <a href=\"/wiki/King_Genn_Greymane\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"King Genn Greymane\">King Genn Greymane</a> captive in order to bargain with the <a href=\"/wiki/Forsaken\" title=\"Forsaken\">Forsaken</a>, Hewell refused to betray his king. Instead he remained by Greymane's side until <a href=\"/wiki/Krennan_Aranas\" title=\"Krennan Aranas\">Krennan Aranas</a> sent an <a href=\"/wiki/Adventurer\" title=\"Adventurer\">adventurer</a> to help.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Objective_of\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Objective of</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Quotes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Quotes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Patch_changes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Patch changes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Objective_of\">Objective of</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"nobreak\"><span class=\"questlong-prefix linkicon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"A\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/2/21/Alliance_15.png/revision/latest?cb=20110509070714\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Alliance 15.png\" data-image-key=\"Alliance_15.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></span></span>&#160;<span class=\"linkicon raceicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6e/IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200520012351\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"IconSmall Worgen Male\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/6e/IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20200520012351\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"IconSmall Worgen Male.gif\" data-image-key=\"IconSmall_Worgen_Male.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></span><span class=\"linkicon raceicon\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/64/IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif/revision/latest?cb=20200520022309\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"IconSmall Worgen Female\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"15\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"IconSmall Worgen Female.gif\" data-image-key=\"IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/6/64/IconSmall_Worgen_Female.gif/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/15?cb=20200520022309\" /></a></span></span>&#160;[1-30]&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Flank_the_Forsaken\" title=\"Flank the Forsaken\"><span class=\"ajaxttlink questlink\">Flank the Forsaken</span></a></span>: Speak to Lord Hewell to obtain a ride to the <a href=\"/wiki/Livery_Outpost\" title=\"Livery Outpost\">Livery Outpost</a> (optional)</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Quotes\">Quotes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<dl><dt>Gossip</dt></dl>\n<p>It is not the time to turn against one another, &lt;name&gt;.\n</p>\n<dl><dd><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Gossip\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gossipgossipicon.png\" data-image-key=\"Gossipgossipicon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/f/fd/Gossipgossipicon.png/revision/latest?cb=20180220125858\" /></span></span>&#160;I need a horse.</dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Patch_changes\">Patch changes</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><span style=\"display:inline-block; min-width: 50px; text-align:center\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/World_of_Warcraft:_Cataclysm\" title=\"Cataclysm\"><img alt=\"Cataclysm\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"39\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-image-key=\"Cata-Logo-Small.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/wowpedia/images/e/ef/Cata-Logo-Small.png/revision/latest?cb=20120818171714\" /></a></span></span> <b><a href=\"/wiki/Patch_4.0.3a\" title=\"Patch 4.0.3a\">Patch 4.0.3a</a> (2010-11-23):</b> Added.   <i></i><br /></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul class=\"elinks\">\n<li class=\"wowhead\"><a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowhead.com/npc=38764\">Wowhead</a></li>\n<li class=\"sigrie\"><a target=\"_self\" rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.wowdb.com/npcs/38764\">WoWDB</a></li>\n\n</ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261114173242\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.116 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.148 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 819/1000000